                "rotation": 0,
                "svg": "<svg width=\"231\" height=\"248\"><text font-family=\"TypeWriter\" font-size=\"10.0\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#000000\" fill-opacity=\"1.0\">R1\nint e0/0\nip add 12.12.12.1 255.255.255.252\nno sh\nint lo\nip add 1.1.1.1 255.255.255.255\nno sh\nexit\nrouter ospf 10\nrouter-id 1.1.1.1\nnetwork 12.12.12.0 0.0.0.3 area 0\nnetwork 1.1.1.1 0.0.0.0 area 0\nexit\nexit\ndebug ip ospf adj</text></svg>",
